<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.TriggerSoundLimited(Sound: string|uuid, Volume: number, TNE: vector, BSW: vector)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llTriggerSoundLimited(string Sound, float Volume, vector TNE, vector BSW);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Plays <b>sound</b> at <b>volume</b>, centered at but not attached to the object, limited to the box defined by vectors <b>top_north_east</b> and <b>bottom_south_west</b></p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string|uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Sound / sound</td>
          <td>a sound in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in&#32;or a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a>&#32;of a sound</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Volume / volume</td>
          <td>between 0.0 (silent) and 1.0 (loud) (`0.0 <&#61; <b>volume</b> <&#61; 1.0`)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>vector</span></td>
